                        This is a preview of how your content will appear with the selected settings.
                    </p>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm @PreviewBtnClass">Sample Button</button>
                    <span class="badge @PreviewBadgeClass ms-2">Badge</span>
                    <hr class="@PreviewHrClass" />
